{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Getting the Client", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Overcoming Obstacles", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Giving Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>In the workplace, you will often be requested to offer your two cents. There are several ways to give suggestions. </p><p>Here are four ways to give advice:</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Use a <span class=\"strong\">modal verb</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">should</span> be generous and make a good offer.<br/>You <span class=\"strong\">could</span> be generous and make a good offer.<br/>You <span class=\"strong\">ought to</span> be generous and make a good offer.</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">NOTE:</span> <span class=\"italic\">Should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> are stronger than <span class=\"italic\">could</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Use a <span class=\"strong\">question</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Why don't you</span> offer something reasonable?<br/><span class=\"strong\">How about</span> offering something more reasonable? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Put yourself in the person's shoes</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If I were you, I would</span> offer something more reasonable.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Use<span class=\"strong\"> negative forms</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">You don't want to</span> look cheap by making a low offer.<br/><span class=\"strong\">You shouldn't</span> make a low offer.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Dealing with Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>On a daily basis, we are faced with unpleasant situations. Although it is tempting to ignore them, it is far better to deal with problems as they arise. </p><p>Here are three ways to deal with problems:</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Acknowledging the problem</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to acknowledge the existence of a problem", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ve come across</span> a critical issue: the website is already in use.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Asking for help</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use modal verbs to ask for help dealing with a problem", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Should </span>I offer them something?<br/>What <span class=\"strong\">would </span>you suggest I do in a situation like this?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Explaining the problem</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Simple</span> tense to explain a problem and connect it using an adverb clause with \u201c<span class=\"italic\">because</span>\u201d", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">is </span>a problem for us <span class=\"strong\">because </span>we don't have enough knowledge.<br/>This can <span class=\"strong\">be </span>a tricky situation <span class=\"strong\">because </span>we don't know the owner of the website.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "minimal ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the smallest amount possible", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She only went online last year and sales are minimal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you might use in different business situations.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to gross", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make or earn before any deductions such as taxes have been removed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Records show she is grossing less than $10, 000 a year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "domain name", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an address on the internet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The domain name is already owned by an older woman. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "demanded price", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an amount of money that is asked for", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We should double her demanded price. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "per annum", "type": "name"}, {"content": "for each year", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We ought to acknowledge her effort per annum.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of 2\u20133 problems you are having at the office or in the classroom.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the problems in detail (acknowledge and explain them) to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner will give you advice on how to deal with the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose the best piece of advice for each problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, switch roles. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe and discuss how to deal with the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can offer and select the best advice.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le09ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p>Subject: Trouble with Domain Name</p>\nHello Janet,<br/>\nWe've come across a sudden obstacle: WearHollys.com is already in use. All I know is that the company is small and privately owned by a Holly who naturally wants to keep her name. She only went online last year and her sales are minimal: grossing less than $10,000 a year. What would you suggest I do? Should I offer to buy the name?<br/>\nMiranda", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p>RE: Trouble with Domain Name</p>\nHi Miranda,<br/>\nThis can be tricky because we don't know much about the owner. If I were you I would ask what she'd be willing to take. You don't want to look ridiculous by offering too high or too low.<br/>\nJanet", "time": "36500"}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob07re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hello?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hi Janet. Sorry to bother you. It's Miranda here. I just didn't want to send you a dozen e-mails.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: No problem. Is this about the domain name?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. It's owned by an older woman. She asked for $5000! That's not enough! Should I offer her something we'd consider reasonable?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Of course! We ought to give her a year's worth of sales. Why don't you suggest doubling her demanded price? We shouldn't make a low offer. We should come off generous. We ought to acknowledge her effort per annum.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Splendid! I'll let you know how it goes.", "time": "57500"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can offer solutions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When was the last time you had a problem at school or work?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How did you deal with it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Is there a solution to this problem?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Why is Miranda sending Jan